 ### BuildFunctionFromTable
-Constructs a color transfer function from a pre-existing table of colors [S18]. The function range becomes [x1, x2], size is `nodes`, and values are regularly spaced [S18]. The table layout is assumed to be [R1, G1, B1, R2, G2, B2, ..., Rn, Gn, Bn] in a block of memory of size [3*size] [S18].
